      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Considering it's likely a muscle strain, you can try some simple home remedies to help alleviate the swelling. Applying an ice pack wrapped in a towel to the affected area for 15-20 minutes, 2-3 times a day, may help reduce swelling and ease pain. You can also elevate your leg above the level of your heart to reduce blood flow and swelling. Additionally, taking over-the-counter pain relievers like ibuprofen or acetaminophen as directed may help with pain and inflammation.",
