    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i tried some ice but it doesnt really feel that much better. the redness is still there and my calf feels kind of tight/tense. do you think i should take something stronger than ibuprofen just to get the inflammation down? like maybe some aspirin or something else?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
